@Reservation_HostAddress = http://localhost:5002

### Create a reservation (locks seats + creates reservation)
POST {{Reservation_HostAddress}}/api/v1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "screeningId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "seatIds": [
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002"
  ],
  "userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"
}

### Pay for a reservation (Locked → Confirmed)
POST {{Reservation_HostAddress}}/api/v1/reservations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/pay

### Generate tickets for a confirmed reservation
POST {{Reservation_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Ticket/reservation/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Get reservation by ID
GET {{Reservation_HostAddress}}/api/v1/reservations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Get all reservations
GET {{Reservation_HostAddress}}/api/v1/reservations

### Cancel reservation
POST {{Reservation_HostAddress}}/api/v1/reservations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/cancel

### Get available seats for a screening
GET {{Reservation_HostAddress}}/api/v1/reservations/screenings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/available-seats
